  triage:title "read_mail vs read_command semantic divergence" ;
  triage:description "read_mail discards the handoff-accepted flag while read_command limits to one and propagates it. Latent API divergence: router routes only read_command; read_mail/peek_mail/list_mail are currently unrouted trait surface, so this is latent divergence, not live behavior. Confirmed per adjudication." ;
